OL,3,AHenry Zeffman: Andy Burnham and his
OL,4,Achancellor have a battle on their hands
OL,5,
OL,6,FToday's inflation figures underscore
OL,7,Fthat the economy is the biggest
OL,8,Fchallenge facing Andy Burnham.
OL,10,FIt is only 42 days until John Healey's
OL,11,Ffirst Budget, and there is increasingly
OL,12,Fapparent concern at all levels of the
OL,13,Fgovernment and Labour Party about how
OL,14,Fthat Budget can ` or, as it may prove,
OL,15,Fcannot ` substantiate Burnham's
OL,16,Frhetoric about offering the biggest
OL,17,Fchange in British politics in 40 years.
