OL,3,AHenry Zeffman: Andy Burnham and his
OL,4,Achancellor have a battle on their hands
OL,5,
OL,6,FMuch of the tricky economic
OL,7,Fenvironment, yes, is driven by global
OL,8,Ffactors including the persistence, and
OL,9,Fto some degree worsening, of the
OL,10,Fconflicts in the Middle East and
OL,11,FUkraine.
OL,13,FAnd the AI boom pushing up borrowing
OL,14,Fcosts is another issue affecting many
OL,15,Fcountries.
